message: If you use the index, its data pack or its method, please cite it.
title: UK Liveability Index
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Perikov
    given-names: Konstantin
version: 0.7.1
date-released: "2026-11-02"
repository-code: https://github.com/MysterionRise/uk-liveability-index
url: https://github.com/MysterionRise/uk-liveability-index
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Open-data liveability scores for 62,833 neighbourhoods across the UK and Ireland:
  a reproducible pipeline over about 224 open datasets, an API and MCP server, a map
  interface in four languages and an AI assistant whose answers use only numbers from
  the data. The data pack is published under the ODbL.
keywords:
  - liveability
  - open data
  - neighbourhoods
  - United Kingdom
  - Ireland
  - geospatial
